There is a knock on the door.
It is Nina, my neighbour.
She asks: "Hi Maya, how are you?"
"It's going well, thank you," I say.
"I am going to the kommune today."
Nina nods.
"But first you need a phone number," she says.
"You get one at a phone shop."
"Then you go to the kommune."
"The kommune is not far away," she says.
"You take bus number four."
Bus number four.
"Thank you, Nina," I say.
Nina is very kind.
